        #// exists (INDCrmWebRecordGuard). Deduplication (INDCrmSyncMap)
        #// and the business mutation run in the same transaction; a base version mismatch is
        #// reported as divergent and never merged. Container contracts: .codex/ENDPOINTS.md.
